{title: Create in me a clean heart}
{subtitle: Psalms 51:10}
{key: Dm}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] |
| [Dm] | [Am/C] | [Bb] | [A] | ×2

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]I was born in guilt and [Am]sin
My [Bb]mother conceived me [F]in [Dm]shame
You delight in truth [Am]within
Teach [Bb]me wisdom in [C]the hidden [Dm]place
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Bb]Cleanse me with [C]hyssop [Dm]now
[Bb]Wash me and [C]I will be [Dm]clean
[Bb]Whi[C]ter than snow [Dm]I become
[Bb]When your hand removes the [A]stain
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Cre[Dm]ate in [C]me a clean [Bb]heart, O [F]God
Re[Gm]new a stead[Dm]fast spirit within [A]me
Do not [Dm]cast me [C]from your pre[Bb]sence
Do [Gm]not take your ho[A]ly Spirit from [Dm]me
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Hide your face from my [Am]sins
[Bb]Blot out all my guilt and [F]shame [Am7/E]
[Dm]Let me hear joy and [Am]gladness
Let [Bb]the bones [C]you crushed re[Dm]joice
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Create [C]in me a clean [Bb]heart, O [F]God
Re[Gm]new a stead[Dm]fast spirit within [A]me
Do not [Dm]cast me [C]from your pre[Bb]sence
Do [Gm]not take your ho[A]ly Spirit from [Dm]me
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Bb]Truth is [C]deep in your [Dm]nature
[Bb]Wisdom in the [C]hidden [Dm]place
[Bb]I am [C]washed by your [Dm]mercy
[Bb]Whiter than [C]snow in your grace
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Dm]Create in me [C]a clean [Bb]heart, O [F]God
Re[Gm]new a steadfast [Dm]spirit within [A]me
Do not cast [Dm]me from [C]your pre[Bb]sence
Do not [Gm]take your holy [A]Spirit from [Dm]me
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Bb]Steadfast [A]spirit within [Dm]me
[Bb]Holy [A]Spirit re[Dm][Am/C]main [Bb][C][Dm]
{end_of_verse}
